{"version":1,"content":"<p>港鐵於今日（24日）推出車費半價優惠，憑八達通乘搭港鐵、輕鐵及港鐵巴士或以二維碼乘搭港鐵重鐵網絡之付款車程，可享車費半價優惠，包括來往羅湖站及落馬洲站的車程 。</p><p>優惠可與轉乘優惠、特惠站優惠及全月通連接車程75折優惠同時使用，節省更多。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:44:06.138352+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T16:10:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T03:18:10.193362+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:38:13.292314+00:00","content_hash":"b882c8f3e4c8e2f967662735fdf319c0bc30e645f678a9bfa1dcaa5b8448daea","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}